<title>UK: UK cabinet set committee on E-Coli deaths.</title>
<headline>UK cabinet set committee on E-Coli deaths.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British cabinet agreed on Thursday to set up a ministerial committee to examine the national implications of Scotland's outbreak of E-Coli food poisoning in which 11 people have died, an aide to Prime Minister John Major said.</p>
</text>
